  <item>
    <title>EP. 13 从留学群的八卦到韩江的素食者，寻找男女彼此尊重的道路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672241c433c798676f333ca0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672241c433c798676f333ca0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Oct 2024 14:33:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家晚上好，欢迎光临【小北门】今天这期的话题我们邀请了老嘉宾【春哥】！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客始于一个八卦，但最终是对尊重与爱的思考！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期内容稍微有点长，若各位能够耐心听完，我们也非常期待各位的留言与讨论~</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a> </span><strong><span>问题一：该男生是否是个渣男？</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="531">08:51</a> 关于“性骚扰”的定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> “赞美”与骚扰的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a> “谈恋爱”交友还是骚扰？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> 真实动机还是话语上的开脱？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">19:19</a> </span><strong><span>问题二：网络挂人、踢出群组，是否过分了？</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 女性独有的“恐惧”生命体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 挂人或许是一种最后的办法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">32:42</a> 原因可能是我们没法处理好“私域”问题</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2268">37:48</a> </span><strong><span>关于诺奖《素食者》的思考</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2291">38:11</a> 我们或许还没学会“爱的能力”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2395">39:55</a> 《素食者》简介奉上!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2731">45:31</a> 我们有被“接纳”吗？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期音乐</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>Daniel Paterok - Serenity</span></p><span></span><p><span>MIIA - Dynasty （ Piano）</span></p><span></span><p><span>ROSÉ &amp; Bruno Mars - APT</span></p><span></span><p><span>Something in Water</span></p><span></span><p><span>Kristene DiMarco - You Make Me Brave</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期封面来源于网络，若侵权请联系删除</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>希望这期博客能伴大家入眠，各位晚安！</span></p>]]></description>
