  <item>
    <title>EP 08 懒人出游｜旅游攻略用孤独星球做可以吗？夏威夷千万不要打出租！绿皮火车游金华</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663ccb1df3517e63e4b75bc3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663ccb1df3517e63e4b75bc3</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 May 2024 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024年5月10日，天气晴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿枝与柯全回顾了四月中旬到五一节的出游活动，辗转的太平洋飞行与绿皮火车呼啸而过的清晨，记录了我们这一期春末夏初的出游</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>一只船孤独地航行在海上，</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>它既不寻求幸福，</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>也不逃避幸福，</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>它只是向前航行，</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>底下是沉静碧蓝的大海，</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>而头顶是金色的太阳。</span></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Highlight</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 阿枝别出心裁，用《孤独星球》做攻略，挑战互联网某书攻略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a>在夏威夷大岛体验21世纪初“上车睡觉下车尿尿”团</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a>柯全闲散的攻略，如何把所有玩乐集中在一起又能chill旅行？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="933">15:33</a>旅游中的趣事——不会游泳的阿枝在北太平洋浮潜时“恐高症”发作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1377">22:57</a>趣事2——在爱马仕偶遇“消失的丈夫”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1577">26:17</a>简单的夏威夷攻略：1）如何出行 2）玩三天能玩啥？3）吃什么，贵吗？4）大体开销</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a>柯全上演人在囧途——4月30日如何成功购买五一出行票，长三角高铁2小时变成凌晨在绿皮火车上吃饺子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2584">43:04</a> 柯全沉浸式 city walk，多年好友惨遭拒绝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2854">47:34</a>推荐一本旅行小书《旅行的艺术》，生动描绘旅行中的百无聊赖，被其中的情侣吵架笑死</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期音乐</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>What A Wonderful World - Louis Armstrong (Kina Grannis and Imaginary Future Cover)</span></p><span></span><p><span>分分钟需要你 - 回春丹（cover）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fly Me To The Moon - Frank Sinatra (2008 Remastered)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Yellow - Coldplay</span></p><span></span><p><span>Yesterday Once More - Carpenters</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面图源：阿枝拍摄于黄昏的沙滩</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>一些旅行碎片分享</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkCKcxPGf0x9kJFQ6WEcFFHn5gPu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>看到北太平洋的海豚与海龟</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhoZ_FrpFWVqiZJbzbhQE4kFSaiG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《旅行的艺术》导览截图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkCAqTp9uqexjpthTWGiysm6JynH.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrKuJpQTbs_4mjx2um07AdIHGCE2.m4a" length="79555488" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmTilS4Lmz3VlSqTNAwtqQ8nvFok.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
